.\" Man Page for meta-get
.TH "meta-get" "1"
.SH "NAME"
meta-get \- utils for get file meta info.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B meta-get [OPTION] <path> [keys..]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
meta-get
This program provides several commands for get file meta info.
.TP
\fB -t, --tree\fR
Tree
.TP
\fB -f, --file\fR
Tree file
.TP
\fB -r, --recursive\fR
Recursive
